flowchart LR
  PR[Pull request] --> L[Lint + typecheck]
  L --> U[Unit + MockMvc + architecture tests]
  U --> D[Docker ITs: Testcontainers]
  D --> B[Build jars + SPA bundle]
  B --> E[Playwright e2e on local stack]
  E --> I[Image build + vulnerability scan]
  I --> R[Registry]
  R --> S[Deploy staging: migrate, smoke]
  S --> C[Canary 5 percent]
  C --> P[Full rollout]
  C -. SLO breach .-> RB[Automatic rollback]
